<title>UK: RTZ up further on copper, CRA advance.</title>
<headline>RTZ up further on copper, CRA advance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in RTZ Corp Plc on Friday extended the week's gains amid recently strong copper prices and an advance in shares of its Australian unit CRA, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is just on the strong copper price and gains in CRA,&quot; said one trader. Volume was a modest 1.8 million shares.</p>
<p>RTZ was up 14p at 978 by 1417 GMT, up from 922-1/2p at last Friday's close. CRA -- also up strongly this week -- closed up 5 Australian cents at A$20.05.</p>
<p>Earlier this week copper reached a five-month high around $2,240 a tonne.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
